      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah I agree, clicking the drop-down, copying and then pasting into the VRCam every single time we make changes to an avatar is really annoying, especially for someone like me who edits their avatars all the time to attempt to get them perfect, it's just too much.",
