      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Next time you go to upload an image, before you click upload, make a duplicate of the VRCCam. Next time you want to upload a new image using the same settings, click on the gear/cog next to the camera component and transform component and press copy component. Then go to the real VRCCam and click the same cog/gear and press Paste component values. It will set the new camera up just like the old one with very little effort (much less than setting it up from scratch every time)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
