  "details": "It would be amazing to be able to place camera prefab on scene once and have sdk use it if it's there. It's quite annoying when you have to set everything up each time you want to take a picture. That way creators could prepare scenes with Camera setups for image already ready in certain style instead of having to redo it everytime.",
